data: {"id": "f3497b4020b14ba1-thinking-parallel_evidence-938", "run_id": "f3497b4020b14ba1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "日志查询结果符合预期：Pod 从未成功启动过（重启次数为0，reason=ImagePullBackOff），所以没有 previous 日志，init container configure-sysctl 在当前 yaml 中也不存在（之前的 baseline 可能是其他 Pod 的模板）。\n\n现在我已经有足够的证据来给出结论了。让我整理：\n\n**已采集事实：**\n\n1. **Prometheus Metrics**:\n   - `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}` = 1（Pod 仍在 Pending）\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}` = 1（容器仍在等待，原因是 ImagePullBackOff）\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0（从未成功启动过）\n   - Pod UID: `6d7ef0ba-939d-4371-a7d9-b332d976d782`", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788414406309, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

