data: {"id": "f3497b4020b14ba1-thinking-parallel_evidence-1130", "run_id": "f3497b4020b14ba1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我需要根据已有的工具结果，对 `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` 进行根因证据采集。让我先制定计划并执行关键工具。\n\n**首轮计划：**\n1. `kubectl_describe pod` - 确认当前状态、容器状态、事件\n2. `kubectl_events` - 获取详细事件，特别是 ImagePull 相关错误\n3. `kubectl_get_yaml` - 获取完整 Pod spec，确认镜像配置\n4. `query_pod_topology` - 确认 Pod 拓扑关系（owner、node、container）\n5. `kubectl_previous_logs_all_containers` - 检查是否有 previous 容器日志\n6. `kubectl_container_logs` - 检查特定容器日志\n7. `run_bash_command` - 补充获取事件排序信息\n\n让我并行执行这些工具调用：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788414417651, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

